  "description": "ANEVUL crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C70 H76 Dy4 N8 O26,4(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2B (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.563-3.842 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.22-107.08°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C74H92Dy4N8O30.",
